<reference id="_Toc235450343" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Scenario 2 — Heading level hierarchy</title>
   <shortdesc>Consider an HTML document where an &lt;h1&gt; element groups related &lt;h2&gt; sections but contains no</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>Heading</keyword>
        <keyword>Installation</keyword>
        <keyword>level</keyword>
        <keyword>hierarchy</keyword>
        <keyword>mapref</keyword>
        <keyword>ditamap</keyword>
        <indexterm>Heading</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Installation</indexterm>
        <indexterm>level</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <refbody>
      <section>
      <p>Consider an HTML document where an <codeph>&lt;h1&gt;</codeph> element groups related <codeph>&lt;h2&gt;</codeph> sections but contains no direct body content of its own. All paragraphs, tables, and images appear under <codeph>&lt;h2&gt;</codeph> or deeper heading levels.</p>
         <table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Heading level hierarchy</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <b>HTML Input</b>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <b>DITA Output</b>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>
&lt;h1 id="installation">Installation&lt;/h1>
&lt;h2 id="prerequisites">Prerequisites&lt;/h2>
&lt;h3 id="system-requirements">System Requirements&lt;/h3>
&lt;h2 id="installing-the-server">Installing the Server&lt;/h2></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                     <entry>
                        <codeblock>
&lt;map id="m001_installation">
    &lt;title>Installation&lt;/title>
    &lt;topichead navtitle="Installation">
        &lt;mapref href="t001_prerequisites.ditamap"/>
        &lt;mapref href="t002_system_requirements.ditamap"/>
        &lt;mapref href="t003_installing_the_server.ditamap"/>
    &lt;/topichead>
&lt;/map></codeblock>
                     </entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table>
<p><b>Result:</b>No .dita topic file is created for <b>Heading 1: Installation</b> because it has no body content. The converter maps it to a <codeph>&lt;topichead&gt;</codeph> element and nests the related <b>Heading 2</b> and <b>Heading 3</b> topics under it.</p>
         </section>
   </refbody>
</reference>
